keywords Blackmaw Hold, Azshara, Talrendis Point, Commander Truesong, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, Darnassus, Archmage Timear, Dalaran, Ogtinc, Ekkal, Gatekeeper Rageroar, Ursolan, Unele, Withermaw, Impaan, Bloodmane, Bonesnout, Varrox, Behemoth, Unbound Spirit, root caps, pouch, necklace, dungeon
