step To Blackmaw Hold
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 55 to 60, in Azshara.
  enter "Blackmaw Hold"

step Root caps and pouches
  along until leave
  collect 250773 x10 quest 92344.1 group 5 -- The Nordrassil Root Caps grow inside.
  collect 273050 x5 quest 97327.1 group 5 -- The Blackmaw and its bosses drop the pouches.

step Withermaw
  tip The first boss in the client's journal. He drops the Claws of the Great Bear.
  collect 249697 quest 92069.1 group 5

step Elder Shaman Bloodmane
  tip Impaan the Imprisoner comes before him in the client's journal. Bloodmane drops the Blackmaw Ritual Totem.
  collect 276893 quest 97173.1 group 5

step Bonesnout the Unbroken
  tip He drops the Tusks of the Unbroken.
  collect 249696 quest 92069.2 group 5

step Varrox Bleakhoof
  tip He drops his head for Gatekeeper Rageroar. Impaan and Varrox may also drop the Feathered Charm Necklace, which starts a quest. The Blackmaw Behemoth and the Unbound Spirit come after him in the client's journal; no quest needs them but the pouches.
  collect 249692 quest 92065.1 group 5
  collect 249698 optional -- The Feathered Charm Necklace, if it drops.

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short of the Root Caps and the pouches, finish it before you go.
  collect 250773 x10 quest 92344.1 group 5
  collect 273050 x5 quest 97327.1 group 5

